{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" %}
{#
  Example 02: what this NPC owes the player.

  A character_bio submodule is rendered into every NPC's bio, in file-name order (0600
  relationships, 0700 occupation...), so 0650 lands between them. Adding a file here extends the
  bio without replacing any of SkyrimNet's own prompts.

  actorUUID is the NPC whose bio this is. Everything below is read with decorators while the prompt
  renders, so it is always current:
    papyrus_util          values the mod's Papyrus scripts stored with StorageUtil
    decnpc                the NPC's name and stats
    get_relationship_rank the vanilla relationship rank, -4 (archnemesis) to 4 (lover)
    get_recent_events     event history, filtered here to this mod's own event type

  Render nothing when there is nothing to say: an empty heading costs tokens and invites the
  LLM to invent content for it.
#}
{% if actorUUID != player.UUID %}
{% set owed = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "ExC_FavorsOwed", 0) %}
{% if owed > 0 %}
{% set npcName = decnpc(actorUUID).name %}
{% set lastFavor = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "ExC_LastFavor", "") %}
{% set rank = get_relationship_rank(actorUUID, player.UUID) %}
## Favors Owed
- {{ npcName }} owes {{ player.name }} {{ owed }} favor{% if owed > 1 %}s{% endif %}{% if length(lastFavor) > 0 %}, most recently for {{ lastFavor }}{% endif %}.
{% if rank >= 1 %}
- {{ npcName }} counts {{ player.name }} as a friend and would be glad of a chance to repay.
{% elif rank <= -1 %}
- {{ npcName }} resents being in {{ player.name }}'s debt.
{% else %}
- {{ npcName }} knows the debt is real and means to settle it.
{% endif %}
{% for event in get_recent_events(30, actorUUID) %}{% if event.type == "example_favor" %}
- Remembered: {{ format_event(event, "compact") }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
